{{Quote|"Are you okay, Ben? It cannot be wise to swallow tigers whole, even for a moment."<br>"Nah. When I'm Upchuck, I eat punks like those for breakfast."|[[Rook Blonko|Rook]] and Upchuck.<ref name="TT" />}}
Both Perk Upchuck and Murk Upchuck have the same abilities; neither of them has abilities exclusive to any one Upchuck.{{Refn|[[:File:Perk and Murk Upchucks Share The Same Abilities.png]]|group = DJW}}

Upchuck has three very strong, adhesive tongues{{Refn|[[:File:Thomas Perkins Designed Upchuck With Three Tongues.png]]|group = TNP|name = tongue}}{{Refn|[[Dwayne McDuffie]] claimed that, in '''[[Ben 10: Alien Force (TV Series)|Alien Force]]''' and '''[[Ben 10: Ultimate Alien (TV Series)|Ultimate Alien]]''', Murk Upchuck had four tongues,{{Refn|[[:File:UAF Murk Upchuck Number of Tongues.png]]|group = DM|name = tongue}} which was corroborated by merchandise.{{Refn|[[:File:Upchuck Alien Creation Card.png]]|group=Bandai|name=card2}}{{Refn|''[[Ben 10 Alien Force: Volume 6]]''; [[:File:AF Vol 6 DVD Upchuck Data.png|file]]|group = DVD|name = af dvd}} Despite this, he was only shown using one tongue on-screen.|group = note}} that can stretch to great lengths, allowing them to latch onto large objects, such as an elephant{{Refn|group=Bandai|name=card2}} and objects that weigh 10 tons,<ref name="B10GRHU>''[[Ben 10-Generator Rex: Heroes United|Ben 10/Generator Rex: Heroes United]]''</ref> and reel them in with relative ease. Upchuck's mouth can stretch, allowing him to swallow objects larger than himself. He is connected with a trans-space bladder dimension where [[Gourmand]]s store all the "food" they eat. Through it, Upchuck is connected to the Gourmand species and can sense any danger to his people through his stomach.<ref name="TT" />

Upchuck can eat most any solid matter; energies, such as the [[Sub-Energy]] (something 20 times more powerful than the Sun itself)<ref name="N10P2>''[[Ben 10 vs. Negative 10: Part 2]]''</ref> or a [[Crystalsapien (Classic)|Crystalsapien]]'s energy beams;<ref name="VOV2">''[[Vengeance of Vilgax: Part 2]]''</ref> liquids, such as the [[Mr. Smoothy (Classic)|Mr. Smoothy Mascot]]'s smoothie blasts;<ref name="ICW">''[[In Charm's Way]]''</ref> and even living creatures such as tigers,<ref name="TT"/> [[Crabdozer|Crabdozers]],<ref name="FaFBM">''[[For a Few Brains More]]''</ref> and even [[Celestialsapien (Classic)|Celestialsapiens]].{{Refn|[[:File:Upchuck Eat Celestialsapien.png]]|group = DJW|name = Celestialsapien}}

Items ingested by Upchuck can be converted into explosive balls of green{{Refn|Both Perk and Murk Upchucks' explosive vomits are colored green. Meanwhile, alternate versions of Upchuck are shown firing explosive vomits in different colors. For example, [[Mad Ben|Mad Ben]]'s Perk Upchuck fires orange explosive vomits.<ref name="IaMMMBW1">''[[It's a Mad, Mad, Mad Ben World: Part 1]]''</ref>|group=note}} vomit that can be expelled with great accuracy. The explosive power of these "loogies" depends on the chemical composition and overall size of what Upchuck ate to create them.{{Refn|[[:File:Upchuck Loogie.png]]|group = pop-up}}<ref name="SotO">'''''[[Ben 10: Secret of the Omnitrix]]'''''</ref> The loogies have the blast impact of a hand grenade.{{Refn|group=Bandai|name=card2}} Upchuck can also make his loogies curve like a frisbee.<ref name="SotO"/>

Upchuck is able to fly by propelling himself with his explosive vomit and can survive in the vacuum of space, as demonstrated by various Gourmands.<ref name="TT" />

Upchuck has developed jaws, diamond-hard teeth, and a gastrointestinal tract that allows him to eat almost any material,{{Refn|group = AF Mini Bible|name = bible}} including virtually any object all the way up to [[Ascalon]].{{Refn|[[:File:Upchuck Can Eat Ascalon.png]]|group = DJW}}

Upchuck is able to take a surprising amount of punishment for a creature of his size, taking the force of a moving car impact, as well as surviving after being thrown through a wall.<ref name="B4GB">''[[Ben 4 Good Buddy]]''</ref>

Upchuck can jump surprisingly high for his size, as demonstrated when he was able to fully jump over [[Thunderpig]] to eat his energy flail.<ref name="UVT">''[[Universe vs. Tennyson]]''</ref> Upchuck also has enhanced reflexes.<ref name="FHTE">''[[From Hedorium to Eternity]]''</ref>

Upchuck can carry around objects and living creatures in his stomach, such as the [[Alpha]] Nanite's container and a [[Galvan (Classic)|Galvan]], and release them without having to turn them into explosive vomit.<ref name="B10GRHU>''[[Ben 10-Generator Rex: Heroes United|Ben 10/Generator Rex: Heroes United]]''</ref><ref name="IaMMMBW1"/>

Upchuck can spit out slime, which can be slippery for [[Arburian Pelarota (Classic)|Arburian Pelarotas]]. This slime is also capable of melting ice.<ref name="Duped">''[[Duped]]''</ref>

==Weaknesses==
<gallery type="slideshow">
EvEnc (451).png|Full Cheeks
UPdC (521).png|Inflated Body
FaFBM (420).png|Forced Regurgitation
GB (608).png|Inability to consume Human Food ('''Original Series''' only)
</gallery>
There is a limit as to how much Upchuck can fit in his mouth, as beings as massive as [[To'kustar (Classic)|To'kustars]] would have to be chopped up into bite-size chunks in order to be eaten by him.{{Refn|[[:File:Upchuck May Eat a To'kustar.png]]|group = DJW|name = To'kustar}}

If Upchuck ingests enough matter<ref name="I13">''[[Inspector 13]]''</ref><ref>''[[Evil's Encore]]''</ref> or a powerful enough energy,<ref name="N10P2" /> they can be difficult for him to hold down and not spit out, causing his stomach or cheeks to inflate and severely reduce his mobility. Similarly, if energy is able to explode within Upchuck's mouth, it will also cause him to immediately inflate.<ref>''[[A Fistful of Brains]]''</ref>

Upchuck may struggle to eat living creatures, such as tigers and [[Ultimate Panuncian|Ultimate Panuncians]], as their movement inside his stomach can cause him to regurgitate them.<ref name="TT"/><ref name="FaFBM" />

Upchuck's hunger can be used against him, as he can easily be swayed from any task with the simple promise of a tasty treat.{{Refn|[https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/ben10/images/3/38/AF_Mini_Bible.pdf Alien Force Series Mini Bible]|group = AF Mini Bible|name = bible}}

In the '''[[Ben 10 (2005 TV Series)|Original Series]]''', Upchuck was unable to consume [[Human (Classic)|human]] food.<ref name="B4GB" />{{Refn|[[:File:The Visitor Pop-up (22).png]]|group = pop-up|name=TVPU}}<ref name="TV" /> However, this is no longer true as of '''[[Ben 10: Omniverse (TV Series)|Omniverse]]''', as he can now eat human food as well as everything else,{{Refn|group = DM|name = tongue}}{{Refn|[[:File:Upchuck Can Eat Normal Food.PNG]]|group = DJW}}{{Refn|Despite being shown to be able to drink [[Smoothie (Classic)|smoothies]] in ''[[In Charm's Way]]'' during '''Alien Force''', this was not considered as a retcon by the crew, as the subtext in this scene was that [[Mr. Smoothy (Classic)|Mr. Smoothy]]'s smoothies are so far removed from food that even Upchuck can drink it.{{Refn|[[:File:ICW Scrapped Section.png]]|group = PAD}}|group=note}} evidenced by multiple [[Gourmand]]s fantasizing over eating foods such as steak, frosting, and cake in ''[[Tummy Trouble]]'' and [[Vomit Man]] eating the [[Carrot Monster]] prior to ''[[It's a Mad, Mad, Mad Ben World: Part 1]]''.{{Refn|[[Contradictory Retcons (Classic)|Contradictory Retcons]]|group = BTP|name = retcons}}

==History==
===Ben 10===
*Perk Upchuck first appeared in ''[[The Visitor]]'', where he was unlocked by [[Xylene]] and defeated the [[Mechadroid]].
*In '''''[[Ben 10: Secret of the Omnitrix]]''''', Perk Upchuck was defeated by [[Myaxx]].
*In ''[[Ben 4 Good Buddy]]'', Perk Upchuck battled the [[Road Crew]] and was defeated by [[Turbine]].
*In ''[[Ben 10 vs. Negative 10: Part 2]]'', Perk Upchuck defeated the [[Red Knight]] and [[Sir Driscoll]] and accidentally destroyed [[Mt. Rushmore (Classic)|Mt. Rushmore]] in the process.

===Five Years Prior to Omniverse ===
*In ''[[Evil's Encore]]'', Perk Upchuck stopped [[Dr. Animo (Classic)|Dr. Animo]]'s control of the Plumber Base and accidentally destroyed [[Mt. Rushmore (Classic)|Mt. Rushmore]] in the process for the second time in a row.
*In ''[[From Hedorium to Eternity]]'', Perk Upchuck accidentally broke one of [[Ignacius Baumann|Mr. Baumann]]'s car windows.

===Alien Force=== 
*Perk Upchuck was locked by the Omnitrix's reconfiguration in ''[[Ben 10 Returns: Part 1]]''.
*Murk Upchuck first appeared in ''[[War of the Worlds: Part 1]]'', where he was unlocked by the Master Control. Murk Upchuck battled an army of [[DNAlien]]s and unsuccessfully attempted to destroy the [[Hyperspace Jump Gate]] alongside [[Alien Force|his teammates]] before switching into [[Way Big (Classic)|Way Big]].
*In ''[[Vengeance of Vilgax: Part 2]]'', Murk Upchuck fought and captured the escaped [[Chromastone (Classic)|Chromastone]].
*In ''[[In Charm's Way]]'', Murk Upchuck defeated [[Charmcaster (Classic)|Charmcaster]]'s giant animated [[Mr. Smoothy (Classic)|Mr. Smoothy]].

===Ultimate Alien===
*In ''[[Duped]]'', Rude Ben used Murk Upchuck to battle [[Sir Urien]], but was defeated.
*In ''[[Ben 10,000 Returns]]'', Perk Upchuck was re-unlocked by [[Ben 10,000 (Ultimate Alien)|Ben 10,000]].
*In ''[[The Purge]]'', Murk Upchuck was defeated by the [[Forever Knights]].
*In ''[[Ben 10-Generator Rex: Heroes United|Ben 10/Generator Rex: Heroes United]]'', Murk Upchuck ate the [[Alpha]] Nanite's container to transport it out of [[Rex Salazar (Generator Rex)|Rex]]'s dimension.
*In ''[[Inspector 13]]'', [[Gwen Tennyson (Classic)|Gwen]] as Murk Upchuck helped rescue [[Ben Tennyson (Classic)|Ben]].
*In ''[[Night of the Living Nightmare]]'', Murk Upchuck was seen confronting [[Albedo]] in a dream.

===Omniverse=== 
*In ''[[Tummy Trouble]]'', Upchuck appeared four times. First, Perk Upchuck defeated [[Nyancy Chan]]'s tigers. Later, both Upchucks helped settle peace negotiations between the Perk and Murk [[Gourmand]]s. Lastly, Perk Upchuck helped eat [[Peptos XI]] with the other Gourmands.
*In ''[[Store 23]]'', Murk Upchuck was one of several aliens [[Ben Tennyson (Classic)|Ben Prime]] was showcasing for [[Ben 23]].
*In ''[[A Fistful of Brains]]'', Perk Upchuck was defeated by [[Ultimate Albedo]].
*In ''[[For a Few Brains More]]'', Perk Upchuck ate [[Crabdozer (Transformation)|Crabdozer]] before spitting out [[Ultimate Panuncian (Transformation)]].
*In ''[[The Rooters of All Evil]]'', Perk Upchuck fought the [[Rooters]].
* In ''[[No Honor Among Bros]]'', Perk Upchuck defeated [[Rook Blonko|Rook]] at the Golden Fist Tournament.
*In ''[[Universe vs. Tennyson]]'', Perk Upchuck defeated [[Thunderpig]].
*In ''[[A New Dawn]]'', Perk Upchuck appeared for a short time when [[Ben Tennyson (Classic)|Ben]] was cycling through his aliens.

===Mad Ben's Timeline===
*In ''[[It's a Mad, Mad, Mad Ben World: Part 1]]'', [[Mad Ben|Mad]] Perk Upchuck defeated Ben Prime, Ben 23, and [[Dr. Psychobos]].

