====[[Ben 10: Protector of Earth]]====
Perk Upchuck is a playable alien character in ''Protector of Earth''. He is unlockable with a cheat on the DS version. He deals heavy damage to regular enemies and mini bosses, but not to boss enemies.

====[[Ben 10 Alien Force: Vilgax Attacks]]====
Murk Upchuck is a playable alien in the game, replacing both [[Alien X (Classic)|Alien X]] and [[Cannonbolt (Classic)|Cannonbolt]] in the Nintendo DS version.

Due to the [[Omnitrix (Original)|Omnitrix]] rebooting after [[Ben Tennyson (Classic)|Ben]]'s abuse of the quick-change feature during his battle against [[Vilgax (Classic)|Vilgax]]'s forces, Murk Upchuck was temporarily locked until Ben's arrival in the [[Null Void (Classic)|Null Void]], where both Murk Upchuck and [[Jetray (Classic)|Jetray]] are re-unlocked.

Murk Upchuck is able to consume any enemy projectile and spit it back as a green glowing energy ball. He is the recommended alien during the battle with the animated [[Mr. Smoothy Mascot]].

====[[Ben 10: Omniverse (Video Game)|Ben 10: Omniverse]]====
Perk Upchuck is a playable alien in the game (by 11-year-old [[Ben Tennyson (Classic)|Ben]] only). He is an exclusive for the DS and 3DS version.

